and of course the misinformation that  was flowing during covet has not slowed  down in fact it has gotten worse  according to a new  report from m booth health  a study called the pharma brandemic  more than one thousand demographically  diverse adults across the united states  were polled  and here's what they found the  overwhelming majority of respondents 88  percent have encountered health care  misinformation and nearly three quarters  73 percent are anxious about it  more than one in three believe they come  across false health information almost  every day  so health misinformation  in case you haven't noticed  is growing out of control  these these alleged crackdowns by social  media outlets and youtube like oh we're  not going to let all this you know  misinformation out there we're finally  taking down the massive anti-vaxx  facebook page that should have been  taken down years ago  that by the way that group the  children's health defense i think they  made what six million dollars last year  i think is what i had read um they make  a lot of money whether it's 6 million or  not  they do make a lot of money  and  they were removed because facebook  finally said we think this is  misinformation we've got polio in new  york  that's what medical misinformation does  a million people dead from covet in this  country  that's what medical misinformation  does  but that's not even the striking part of  this study from in booth health  here's the striking part to me  separately  we also this from the daily beast by the  way separately we also surveyed 101  full-time health care providers  almost all 99  of them  said they have patients share  misinformation every week and 90 of  medical professionals are anxious about  this  nearly half 48 percent say they now have  less confidence that patients will  comply with their recommendations  perhaps unsurprisingly the same  percentage of patients 48 percent say  they are now more comfortable  challenging their doctor  so all of this misinformation  and there's another part to it other  than just misinformation i'll get to  that in a moment but all of this  misinformation what it's doing right now  according to doctors and health care  workers is you've got people walking  into the doctor's office the doctor says  okay look you have this problem we're  going to do x y and z we're going to get  you fixed up hopefully and we're going  to make you better  and the patient says now hold on there  jack  i may not have gone to medical school  but i saw on facebook right from this uh  this this very important group they've  got like 10 million followers  they say you're wrong  they say give me the horse medicine  that's what i want maybe i should have  gone to the vet instead  and the doctors like they can't do  anything about it they can sit there and  say well as somebody that went to  medical school and has been practicing  medicine for a couple decades you're  wrong please do what i'm saying  and then the patient leaves and half the  doctors are like yeah that person's not  going to listen to me  doctors are getting burned out from this  the report also states  because you know why the burnout happens  because when that patient that doesn't  want to take the doctor's advice because  they know better because they read it on  facebook  they don't listen to the doctor they get  worse they come back  and no matter how many i told you so as  the doctor gives the patient still  insists  no  i'm still right i may be on my deathbed  because i didn't listen to you but darn  it i'm still right  until of course their final moments as  we saw plenty of times during the  pandemic  people on their death bed saying i wish  i'd gotten the shot  i wish i had taken this seriously  i wish i hadn't followed the  misinformation  that's what we're seeing in this country  and as i mentioned there's another part  of it too  it's not just the misinformation  it's the overwhelming amount of  information  and that overwhelming amount of  information i'm talking about is coming  from the drug drug companies themselves  another thing that's happening that's  also  frustrating doctors to no end  is the fact that we have direct to  consumer advertising of prescription  drugs here in the united states  and what's been happening for 20 years  now  is that patients go into the doctor's  office  not waiting for the doctor to tell them  what they need but they go in and act  like they're ordering at a deli  they say hey doc yeah i've got these  problems but i saw this commercial on tv  i want that drug i want that thing  the people in the commercial looked all  happy they're dancing i want to dance  give me the drug and if you think i'm  making that up  go and look through all the studies from  the last 20 years that have shown that  people are now walking into the doctor's  office demanding give me this thing i  saw on tv  which is why we're one of only two  countries on the planet new zealand  being the other one that even allows  that to happen in the first place the  direct to consumer advertising that's  where we're at today  we're inundated with news from big  pharma  saying hey you need this drug all these  people in the commercial taking it they  look happy they're fun you know they're  living their lives don't you want to  live your life  and then on the other side you have  people saying oh no you don't need any  of this  what you need is to go out there and eat  a couple of handfuls of dirt  and that'll make it all better  don't don't trust big pharma and so we  are stuck in this in between  i have seen  again through my work for almost 20  years with with various law firms i've  seen the documents from big pharma these  folks are scumbags up and down no  question about it  they will lie to your face about a drug  that is going to kill you and tell you  it's the only thing you ever need to  take and you're going to be great  it is difficult to trust these  individuals at the same time they do  still produce life-saving medication  so it's easy to see how you get to that  misinformation  there is a lot of distrust there and  there should be  because again a lot of the people  including some of the prominent  anti-vaxxers they fought these companies  in court  but it skewed them to the point where  they now believe you can't trust  anything  the truth is somewhere in between  and unfortunately for doctors  the public doesn't know what to do they  don't know who to trust  we're just kind of left in the middle  big pharma is greedy big pharma rips us  off  big pharma tries to sell us drugs we  don't need  but they also make things we do need  like vaccines  and life-saving medications  that we just wish we could afford to  take  but then all of that greed  all of those horrible documents  feeds into the you can't trust big  pharma they're only out to kill you  misinformation  it's a vicious cycle  and it is almost entirely  a uniquely american cycle  we have to take another quick break i am  fair and cousins find me on twitter  instagram and facebook at  and cousins i'm in for david pakman this  is the david pakman show and we'll be  right back
 

